{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2744\ufe0f <strong>A Magical Christmas Journey</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an atmospheric holiday adventure across snowy Europe! Cozy markets, ancient towns, and northern landscapes filled with festive spirit await you. Explore historic locations across Europe and Scandinavia, search for hidden objects, solve mini-games, and collect holiday souvenirs to take a piece of winter magic with you. \ud83c\udf84\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746330/extras/6908bd2412fe447e82033f33bba79831.poster.avif?t=1772654327\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746330/extras/6908bd2412fe447e82033f33bba79831.webm?t=1772654327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746330/extras/6908bd2412fe447e82033f33bba79831.mp4?t=1772654327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>New Features &amp; Engaging Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new object-search mechanics and a variety of fresh mini-games. Explore 30 picturesque locations and tourist attractions created especially for this winter voyage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stroll through Berlin\u2019s Christmas market, visit Santa Claus in Finland, walk across Prague\u2019s snowy Charles Bridge, and uncover even more festive corners of Europe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skate on ice rinks, travel by train, ship, and airplane, and enjoy a magical route filled with wonder. To succeed, you\u2019ll need attention, logic, and love for details \ud83c\udf81\u26c4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline 